  "title": "No residual quale can be isolated from reactions and dispositions",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "a5d77b0d-d9bd-4bba-88fc-6222a0012812",
      "text": "Talk of how something tastes to a person at a time presumes the quale can be separated from accompaniments, causes and later dispositions to behave or believe. The deeper mistake is supposing there is such a residual property at all.",
